From a62e00087d12c8e0a3eed0b11b06fe0db5c52991 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rudy Cato <rudy@americanfoodbeverage.local>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 00:41:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Direct link to inventory + share options
 (SMS/email/print)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New dedicated /stock page: mobile-first, staff-gated, just the
  inventory table (search, type filter, low-stock toggle) plus
  Adjust/Location/History actions — nothing else to load first.
  Deliberately a separate path from the /inventory JSON API router
  to avoid a route collision.
- Share bar on /stock: text (SMS) the link, email the link, print a
  count sheet (adds a blank 'Counted qty' column via print stylesheet,
  hides all navigation/buttons), copy link to clipboard.
- Dashboard: same share bar (text/email/print/copy) added to the existing
  inventory section, pointing at /stock. Print opens /stock?print=1 in
  a new tab, which auto-triggers window.print() once data loads.
- Dashboard: /dashboard#inventory now auto-expands the inventory section
  and scrolls to it on load — the quick-deep-link option.
- Nav links to /stock added from dashboard and production headers.
---
